5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's get this started. Since it's Day 0, we have no information. I'll be watching everyone's reactions closely.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I agree. It is best to remain calm and observe how each of you carries yourselves.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm a bit nervous, but let's all try our best to find the werewolf together! I'll do my part!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not scared! I'll find the werewolf and kick them out of here before they can hurt anyone!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a quiet start. I believe a patient approach will serve us best in these circumstances.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your enthusiasm is admirable, but recklessness usually leads to mistakes in this game. Try to think rationally.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,Shunichi is right. We should not rush into accusations without evidence.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I'll try to be the bridge and keep everyone smiling while we figure this out!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I can be rational! I'm just saying we shouldn't be too slow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,Indeed. Balance is key.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
