31,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Now we have our first night's result. Seer, if you've found something, now is the time to consider how to reveal it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,I wonder who the Seer is. I'll be looking for any slips in your stories.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Everyone, listen! I'm the Seer, and I checked Takumi last night. He is the werewolf!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,What?! That's a lie! I'm a villager! Yumi is just trying to frame me because I'm loud!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a very bold claim for the first day. Yumi, are you certain of your result?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, coming out as Seer immediately is a risky move, but it's the most efficient way to win. @Takumi, your reaction is quite aggressive.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"It is unusual to be so certain so quickly, but if Yumi is the Seer, we have our target.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm absolutely sure! I saw it with my own eyes! Please, we have to vote for Takumi!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm not the werewolf! Yumi is the one lying to trick us! Don't listen to her!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If Takumi is the werewolf, he would naturally deny it. However, we must consider if Yumi is the werewolf pretending to be the Seer.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If Yumi were the werewolf, she'd be risking a lot by claiming Seer this early. It's more likely Takumi is the wolf.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"I tend to agree with Shunichi. The logic holds. Takumi, your desperation is showing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Please believe me! I want us all to be safe!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,You're all just ganging up on me! This is unfair! I'm a human!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,It seems the consensus is shifting toward Takumi. It is a regrettable necessity if the divination is true.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I've heard enough. The evidence, though based on trust in Yumi, is the only lead we have.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,I will cast my vote based on the Seer's claim.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, everyone! Let's stop the werewolf now!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'll never give up! You're making a huge mistake!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will follow the majority for the sake of the village.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
